OL,5,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,6,     FThis week we meet resilient,
OL,7,     Finspiring elderly patients,
OL,8,     Fincluding a pensioner with an
OL,9,     Fongoing cough, and a widow
OL,10,     Fdetermined to remain as
OL,11,     Findependent as she can despite her
OL,12,     Failments.
OL,13,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,14,     FIt's another busy day for the
OL,15,     Fcasualty team with patient numbers
OL,16,     Funusually high. Sister Rachel is
OL,17,     Frunning the shift, and she's under
OL,18,     Fpressure with a shortage of
OL,19,     Fcubicles.
