OL,5,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,6,     FDr Dev removes the clinic's
OL,7,     Fheaviest lipoma yet. Dr Natalia
OL,8,     Finvestigates an unsual rash, while
OL,9,     FDr Adil, Dr Emma, and Dr Magnus
OL,10,     Fface cysts and a
OL,11,     Fcareer-threatening lump.
OL,12,G0000 Surgeons: A Matter of Life or
OL,13,G     Death
OL,14,     FWith Syed's life hanging in the
OL,15,     Fbalance as his testicular cancer
OL,16,     Fspreads into his heart, consultant
OL,17,     Furological surgeons must undertake
OL,18,     Fa radical plan to remove the
OL,19,     Ftumour.
