OL,5,G0100 Cold Case Killers
OL,6,     FThe sadistic murder of Wendy
OL,7,     FSpeakes shocked the city of
OL,8,     FWakefield, with evidence
OL,9,     Fsuggesting that a man with a
OL,10,     Ftwisted fetish was on the loose
OL,11,     Fand could kill again.
OL,12,G0200 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,13,     F87-year-old Ralph is struggling to
OL,14,     Fbreathe, Sallie, an 83-year-old is
OL,15,     Frushed in after having a fall, and
OL,16,     FKarina has's dislocated her
OL,17,     Fshoulder for the fifth time.
